# GitHub Linguist overrides
# Mark non-application code so language stats reflect the real project

# Documentation
docs/**           linguist-documentation
*.md              linguist-documentation

# Utility/test scripts (not core application code)
scripts/**        linguist-documentation
asterisk/health-check.sh  linguist-documentation

# Test files
tests/**          linguist-documentation

# Config files (don't count as a language)
*.conf            linguist-documentation
*.yml             linguist-documentation
*.yaml            linguist-documentation
